  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the ginger, onion, and garlic. Cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the pilchards and cook until browned.",
    "Add the yuzu juice, rice vinegar, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Add the rice and stir to coat with the pilchard and yuzu mixture.",
    "Cover the saucepan and reduce heat to low. Simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Fluff the pilaf with a fork and garnish with chopped parsley.",
    "Serve immediately."
  ],
